==German==
{{wp|lang=de}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|sunnentac|sunne(n)tac}}, {{m|gmh|sunntac|sun(n)tac}}, from {{inh|de|goh|sunnūntag}} (9th c.), from late {{inh|de|gem-pro|*sunnōniz dagaz||day of the sun}}, a calque of Latin {{m|la|dies Solis}} (4th c.). Compare Low German {{m|nds|Sünndag}}, Dutch {{m|nl|zondag}}, West Frisian {{m|fy|snein}}, English {{m|en|Sunday}}, Danish {{m|da|søndag}}.

